 that once worshiped dark guardians and performed rituals to guide lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corrupted Cardinal, driven by grief and obsession, has reopened the gates between realms, unleashing the corruption that now consumes the island.<br> Six heroes, each with unique origins and combat styles, are drawn to this place to purge its corruption and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative is environmental and atmospheric, revealed through exploration, enemy design, and fragments of lore scattered throughout the world.<br> Emotional connection emerges from surviving the island\u2019s moral decay and confronting the tragedy behind the fall of the antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c7f74241077dc828dab0988543ac8453.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six playable heroes, each with their own background, combat style, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every character offers a distinct approach to danger, encouraging experimentation and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Samurai \u2022 Swiss Guard \u2022 Exorcist \u2022 Lakota Warrior \u2022 Gaucho \u2022 Shaolin Monk\u00a0\u2022</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c6bf62ec207959a4a7e8390c4070249a.poster.avif?t=1771527995\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c6bf62ec207959a4a7e8390c4070249a.webm?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c6bf62ec207959a4a7e8390c4070249a.mp4?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/51cf0a119bb40cad1964fee984c624ca.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOTS features four progressive difficulty modes that transform enemy behavior, atmosphere, and the overall sense of danger:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual:</strong> Designed for first-time players, with minimal pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal:</strong> The world begins to fight back, and a wandering spirit follows your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard:</strong> Corruption intensifies, and the Cardinal actively hunts you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme:</strong> The ultimate trial, with more enemies, active disadvantages, and critical decisions at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/137451aeccd1539cef6a74f412803e19.poster.avif?t=1771527995\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/137451aeccd1539cef6a74f412803e19.webm?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/137451aeccd1539cef6a74f412803e19.mp4?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulties increase enemy va